# Skills

Installed skills are directories in the project's skills folder (`.cursor/skills/`, `.claude/skills/`, `.opencode/skills/`, or `.agents/skills/`, depending on the client). Each has a `SKILL.md`.

When the user names a skill, or the task is that skill's job, read `SKILL.md` and follow it. Do not retell the skill in chat instead of running it.

If the `{name}` folder is absent there, the skill is not installed. Work without it, or say it is missing.

Stack layout (an app tree, adapters) comes from the matching skill when that folder exists. Do not invent a parallel tree.
